/T (The overflight visualization was designed to show how satellites move above specific countries over a limited period of time. While the orbital structure visualization focuses on the spatial distribution of satellites around Earth, this view introduces a more dynamic perspective. It allows users to observe which satellites pass over a selected country and how frequently these passages occur within a given time window.)
/E (The overflight visualization was designed to show how satellites move above specific countries over a limited period of time. While the orbital structure visualization focuses on the spatial distribution of satellites around Earth, this view introduces a more dynamic perspective. It allows users to observe which satellites pass over a selected country and how frequently these passages occur within a given time window.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
